  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">쥬<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">ᄋᅷ<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">심<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">샬<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Y1H22SMnS5M?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">山盟海誓<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">산ˉ뼹해ˆ세</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兩人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">능랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">우-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">咒誓<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쥬`좌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sān-bieng-hâi-se lân-nng-láng u-jiù-joā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為怎樣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">위좔ˆ율ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">偏偏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">폔ˉ폔ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">애<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">變卦<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">볜`과</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    wi-joâ̰-yṵ̄ lì phiēn-phiēn-ài-pièn-koa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">𣍐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">曉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄒᆤ`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">哪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.3em\">나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">虛華<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">희ˉ화ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà siṵ-boe-hiàu lì nà e-jiâh-hī-hoâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欺騙<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">키ˉ폔</rt></ruby>’<ruby style=\"position: relative\">ᄅᆤ<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">刺激<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">치`곅</rt></ruby>’둏꽈\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khī-phien’liàu goà chì-kiek&#8217;tioh-goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n   <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">石頭<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">죻ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">爛<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">놔ˉ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">請<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">챨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">애<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">相信<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">셩ˉ신</rt></ruby>’꽈\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jioh-tháu e-noā, chiâ̰-lì ài-siōng-sin&#8217;goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">最後<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">줴`ᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">結果<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">곋ˆ고`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">也<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">야-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">較<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">縒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">좧ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    juè-āu’e kiêt-kò ya-si-bo-khâh-joâh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">凝心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꼥심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">毋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">음-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">驚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">酒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">쥬`</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">厚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄀᅷˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雄雄<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">형형-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一喙<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇취</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">飲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">림ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">予<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">허-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">焦<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">다ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gieng-sîm m-kiā̰-jiù kāu, hiong-hiong-jit-chui līm-hor-tâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">上好<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">셩호`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">醉死<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쥐`시`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">매<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">活<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">왛ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siong-hò jùi-sì mài-kôh-oâh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    앟 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">醉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쥐</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">醉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쥐</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">醉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쥐</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ah goà bo-jui goà bo-jui bo-jui\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">請<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">챨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">毋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">음-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">免<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">同情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">덩졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’꽈\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    chiâ̰-lì m-biên-tong-jiéng&#8217;goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">酒<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">쥬`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolu